/ An empty tab, with the ways out of it. what names the kind of result,
/ counts are its results by district id, tab the tab's parameter for the
/ minutes; search_page and scope_name are the search page's own. Topic, kind
/ and attachments narrow only the Drucksachen.
- elsewhere = counts.except(@district&.id).values.sum
.py-3
  p.mb-2= "Keine #{what} zu „#{@term}“ in #{scope_name}."
  ul.small.mb-4
    - unless local_assigns[:tab]
      - if @topic
        li= link_to "Ohne das Thema #{@topic.label} suchen", search_page.call(topic: nil)
      - if @kind
        li= link_to 'Alle Drucksachenarten durchsuchen', search_page.call(kind: nil)
    - if @district && elsewhere.positive?
      li= link_to "In allen Bezirken suchen (#{number_with_delimiter elsewhere} Treffer)",
          search_page.call(district: nil, tab: local_assigns[:tab])
    - unless local_assigns[:tab] || @attachments
      li= link_to 'Auch in Anhängen suchen', search_page.call(attachments: 'true')
    li Einzelne Wörter finden mehr als ganze Sätze.
  = render 'search/examples'
